    - WinXP is not only 2x slower than previous versions, 
      - it has random pauses.  
  - Using PuTTY on MS Windows is another.  
    - PuTTY on Win98SE is pretty fast.  
    - PuTTY is 
      - free, 
      - more stable, and 
      - faster than MS terminal software offerings.
      - It's also a snap to install/uninstall
        - Just copy it to your computer.
        - Run it.
  - Finally, you can try raising the priority of the process running
    your terminal software.  Here I'll need suggestions from others 
    to help.

